          "type": "math",
          "tex": "\\epsilon = 2^{-53}",
          "text": "\\epsilon = 2^{-53}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Summing "
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "tex": "n",
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " numbers one after another lets those errors pile up, which is why a ticket that costs $5 and a meal at $10 can add up to 15.000000000000002 in a spreadsheet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "math",
      "text": "\\Bigl| \\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i - \\operatorname{fl}\\Bigl(\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\Bigr) \\Bigr| \\le (n-1)\\,\\epsilon \\sum_{i=1}^{n} |x_i|",
      "tex": "\\Bigl| \\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i - \\operatorname{fl}\\Bigl(\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\\Bigr) \\Bigr| \\le (n-1)\\,\\epsilon \\sum_{i=1}^{n} |x_i|"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Pairwise summation brings the bound down to a logarithmic factor, and Kahan summation removes most of it for a few extra operations per element."
